  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "主线程契约",
      "items": [
        "订阅前 checkMainThread：非主线程先 onSubscribe(空 Disposable) 再 onError(IllegalStateException)，直接返回",
        "监听器继承 MainThreadDisposable，onDispose 里把 View 的 listener 置空，避免互相强引用"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "首值语义",
      "items": [
        "InitialValueObservable.subscribeActual 先 subscribeListener 再 onNext(initialValue)，textChanges 因此立即拿到 view.text",
        "skipInitialValue 返回内部 Skipped，只挂监听器不发首值"
      ]
    }
  ]
